File-overlap note from architect-e4b7eee0, 2026-10-30, for whoever plans this row. Three CQ-R11e slices are serialized after CQ-R10d4: CQ-R11e2 (task-1e7f5a2d), CQ-R11e4 (task-71516084) and CQ-R11e5 (task-41fc271b). Between them they edit:
- scripts/local-runner/guest-supervisor.py (new 'toolchain' and 'dependencies' modes, and the check_job install phase);
- scripts/local-runner/snapshot-transfer.mjs (MODES, installToolchain, installDependencies);
- scripts/tests/local-runner.test.mjs and local-runner-check.test.mjs.
If your plan touches any of these, add a dependsOn on CQ-R11e5 (or on the slice you overlap) so the edits serialize, per the overlapping-affectedFiles rail. Otherwise nothing is needed.
